aws in their secluded family home. As one by one they are transformed into Deadites—turning the gathering into a family reunion from hell—she comes to discover that the vows she took in life... live on even in death.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn unleashes the franchise’s most savage and terrifying ride to date, blazing onto big screens with an all-new chapter of carnage and demonic mayhem. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, gore\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YYkUkyfjUKg\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008177\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009258\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019021\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019022\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019023\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019024\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000303\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3c50ff95-67b2-4152-9965-ad2431794116\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008964\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010114\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"STUDIOCANAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00009072\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Invite\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \\nHave they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \",\"translations\":[]},\"c